          "headline": "Iran's Guards say they hit US radars in Bahrain; Bahrain says a factory was set ablaze",
          "summary": "Iran's Revolutionary Guards say a missile and drone attack late on Saturday struck two US Patriot radars at Bahrain's Riffa and Awali bases, in reply to US drone flights over Iran. Bahrain denies any radar damage; it says it intercepted several Iranian attacks and one hit a civilian industrial site in Sitra, causing a fire but no injuries. On the same day UKMTO reported two tankers hit by projectiles near Khasab in the Strait of Hormuz, with no casualties.",
